==Description==
'''Champion Templar Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[PVP Season 0]] as a reward for getting to Lieutenant III rank.

==Appearance==
The '''Champion Templar Charm''' appearance is based on the [[Champion Templar]] boss while it is holding its minigun. It also features a red orb effect on it. It plays a sound from one of the [[Champion Templar]]'s abilities.

The color of the '''Champion Templar Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is golden in its preview in the inventory.

